<title>USA: PTI sees Q1 sales exceeding $6 mln.</title>
<headline>PTI sees Q1 sales exceeding $6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HASTINGS-ON-HUDSON, N.Y. 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>PTI Holding Inc said Thursday that first quarter sales would exceed $6 million, up from $2.6 million a year earlier.</p>
<p>The company did not estimate earnings for the quarter, saying they could not be determined.</p>
<p>PTI Holding is a maker of bicycle helmets and accessories.</p>
